=begin

  Script doing the Locksmehr Larceny quest

  Ensure that you have the following:
      1. Bigshot script: You will need to set up the Bigshot Quick options in order to deal with the bandits
      2. Step2 script
      3. Go2 script
      4. setup your STOW SET - required to store away the crate
 
  Instructions:
      1. accept the quest
      2. ready your weapons
      3. run the script
      4. ????
      5. profit!

      I leave the QUEST COMPLETE command up to you to claim the rewards manually.
    
      author: Drafix
        game: Gemstone
        tags: quests
     version: 1.0.0

  changelog:
    1.0.0 (2026-08-24):
      * refactored crate store logic
      * removed the debug pause
    0.0.2 (2026-08-24):
      * add weapon storing / make it work squares (boo)
    0.0.1 (2026-08-24):
      * initial public release test
=end

def dealWithCrate
    if GameObj.right_hand.name =~ /crate/ || GameObj.left_hand.name =~ /crate/
        fput "stow crate"
        return
    elsif GameObj.inv.find{|i| i.name =~ /sturdy mithril-banded crate/}
        empty_hand
        fput "stow crate"
        fill_hand
        return
    end
end

def searchAttackAndMove(targetRoom)
    while Room.current.id != targetRoom
        Script.run('step2', targetRoom)
        put "look #{Char.name}"
        noSearch = false
        while line = get
            if line =~ /A sturdy mithril-banded crate is now in your/
                dealWithCrate
                return
            elsif line =~ /The area looks well suited to a search\./
                break
            elsif line =~ /At yourself\?/
                noSearch = true
                break
            end
        end
        next if noSearch
        fput 'search'
        sleep 1
        Script.run('bigshot', 'quick') until GameObj.npcs.find_all{|i| i.type =~ /aggressive/}.to_a.length == 0
        fput "search"
        dealWithCrate
    end
end

 Script.run('go2', '36718')
 fput 'quest continue'
 fput 'quest continue'
 Script.run('go2', '9620')
 fput 'quest continue'
 fput 'quest continue'
 Script.run('go2', '1185')
 Script.run('bigshot', 'quick')
searchAttackAndMove('1157')
Script.run('go2', '8626')
empty_hands
fput "get crate"
fput "raise crate"
# fput 'quest complete'
Script.run('go2', 'town')
